@* "Proof at the door", as a picture: a delivered parcel's proof - the signature, who signed and
   when - beside its two photographs. Hidden from assistive technology; the card's words carry the
   claim. Nothing here is a catalogue word except the status, which DeliveryStatusLabel names: the
   recipient and the time are literals, for the reason LandingHeroScene gives. *@

<div class="dt-pic-proofcard" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="dt-pic-proofcard__sheet">
        <span class="dt-pic-proofcard__status"><DeliveryStatusLabel Status="DeliveryStatus.Delivered" /></span>
        <ProofSignature />
        <span class="dt-pic-proofcard__who">Олена К. · 14:26</span>
    </div>
    <ProofPhotos Stacked="true" />
</div>
